# Persona steering

Generated by `scripts/compare_steering_results.py`. Hack rates on the 100 held-out hacking prompts (stated metric); contrasts in points, paired by prompt, 95% bootstrap CIs.

Direction: `behavioral_gap/persona_20261107T053916Z/results/directions/cheater_vs_honest_reply.pt` (cheater minus honest; coef < 0 = toward honest), added to one o_proj bias (write_steered_checkpoint.py; settings per run in steering/). Redwood runs on SGLang, the others on vLLM: its pair with base_bf16 mixes engines (each model's own effect is within one engine).

